This is a modified version of an old YAFTI version used in Bazzite. Original GitHub repo: https://github.com/ublue-os/yafti

How to compile this on your system:

1. Clone the repo on your machine

2. Make a virtual Python enviroment (skip if you prefer to use pipx for some reason)

3. Run "python3 install ."

